CHAPTER.VERS:
I came near unto 

          Meaning one of the angels, as in {{See Dan_7:10}}
         one of them that stood by, and asked him the truth of all this. So he told me, and made me know the interpretation of the things.

Then I would know the truth of the fourth beast, which was
For the other three monarchies were governed by a king, and the Roman empire by consuls: the Romans changed their governors yearly, and the other monarchies retained them for term of life: also the Romans were the strongest of all the others, and were never at peace among themselves. diverse from all the others, exceeding dreadful, whose teeth [were of] iron, and his nails [of] brass; [which] devoured, brake in pieces, and stamped the
Read (Dan_7:7). residue with his feet;

I beheld, and the same 

          Meaning the Roman emperors, who were most cruel against the Church of God, both of the Jews and of the Gentiles.
         horn made war with the saints, and prevailed against them;

And the ten horns out of this kingdom [are] ten kings [that] shall arise: and another shall rise after them; and he shall be diverse from the first, and he shall subdue 

          {{See Dan_7:8}}
         three kings.
